	AFTER @TASK.FEAT70
	WAVE @WAVE.6
	RATIONALE "The display flow shows a loaded save read-only and holds no state for a pending"
		+ "edit. The edit mode adds that state in the user interface, core-mapping holding the"
		+ "draft, and exports through the download path extracted from the merge result rather than"
		+ "inventing a second one. An export the validator refuses offers nothing to download: the"
		+ "failure notice follows the single error idiom of the package, under the button that"
		+ "produced it, and the located messages are the ones the single validator produced"
		REF @PACKAGE.ui_save_manager
		REF @DECISION.UiSaveManagerHasOneUiErrorIdiom
		REF @DECISION.ValidationIsTheSingleSourceOfWarnings
		REF @TASK.FEAT69
