TASK FEAT73
	TITLE "Edit the terraformation unit levels and recompute the index and the biomass"
	STATUS draft
	SPEC "the seven unit levels of a planet are edited and carry their new value into the exported"
		+ "save"
	SPEC "the terraformation index and the biomass are not edited, and follow the unit levels as"
		+ "they are edited"
	SPEC "the purification level accepts the minus one that means not unlocked, and refuses every"
		+ "other negative value"
	AFTER @TASK.FEAT71
	WAVE @WAVE.6
	RATIONALE "The section displays nine values for a planet: seven unit levels the save carries"
		+ "and two sums it does not, the index over oxygen, heat, pressure, purification and"
		+ "biomass, and the biomass over plants, insects and animals. A save has no field to write"
		+ "an index or a biomass back to, so they stay read-only and are recomputed from the edited"
		+ "levels. The planet identifier heading the planet is the key binding the levels to the"
		+ "world objects placed on that planet and is not edited. The purification sentinel is the"
