TASK FEAT79
	TITLE "Write a new save file applying the fixes the caller selected"
	STATUS draft
	SPEC "applying a selection of fixes produces new save content, leaves the content it was given"
		+ "untouched, and reports the validation of the result"
	SPEC "the fixes the rewrite itself carries are applied whatever the selection, and the result"
		+ "lists them"
	SPEC "the result names the issues that remain and the selected fixes that could not be applied,"
		+ "each with its reason"
	SPEC "a player identifier beyond the range of a double comes out of the repair as the same"
		+ "decimal text it went in with"
	SPEC "a save carrying the legacy twelve part format comes out in the eleven section format, and"
		+ "the result says that the terrain layers are not carried over"
	AFTER @TASK.FEAT78
	WAVE @WAVE.7
	RATIONALE "This is where the repair writes. The whole result is produced by parsing the"
		+ "rejected save, applying the selected fixes to the parsed sections and serializing them"
		+ "again, so the two defects the round trip already mends cost no fix code and the third,"
		+ "several host players, is a single assignment on the players section. Serializing is what"
		+ "makes the repair risky rather than the fixes: the entry serializer refuses a nested"
		+ "value, so a save whose corruption is a nested field cannot be written at all and has to"
		+ "come back as a named failure instead of a thrown error; the identifier of a player is"
		+ "written as its exact decimal text and must not be parsed into a number on the way"
		+ "through; and the serializer writes ten sections, so a legacy save is converted whether"
		+ "or not the user asked. The result is validated again before it is handed back, exactly"
		+ "as the merge validates its own output, and what remains is reported rather than"
		+ "swallowed"
		REF @DECISION.ValidationIsTheSingleSourceOfWarnings
		REF @RULE.APlayerIdentifierIsCarriedAsExactDecimalText
		REF @RULE.FloatFieldsCarryADotZeroSuffixInFlatRecords
		REF @RULE.ASaveHasElevenSectionsTheLastReservedAndEmpty
		REF @RULE.APlayerEntryCarriesCameraViewAndItsLifetimeTotals
		REF @SECTION.Players
		REF @SECTION.Reserved
		REF @TASK.FEAT78
		REF @PACKAGE.core_mapping
	SOURCE "User ruling of 2026-09-21 on pull request #108: on confirmation a new save file is"
