	SPEC "a WAVE entity requires BRANCH, the integration branch every task pull request of the wave"
		+ "targets"
		IMPL "docs/_schema.awawa::FIELD BRANCH string"
	SPEC "the WAVE field of TASK is a reference to a WAVE entity, and every task carrying a wave"
		+ "resolves to one"
		IMPL "docs/_schema.awawa::FIELD WAVE @WAVE"
	SPEC "wave 5 carries milestone skeo and branch integration/save-format-preserved"
		IMPL "docs/awawa-project-methodology/waves.awawa::MILESTONE \"skeo\""
		IMPL "docs/awawa-project-methodology/waves.awawa::BRANCH"
			+ "\"integration/save-format-preserved\""
	SPEC "wave 6 carries milestone save-edition and branch integration/save-edition"
		IMPL "docs/awawa-project-methodology/waves.awawa::MILESTONE \"save-edition\""
		IMPL "docs/awawa-project-methodology/waves.awawa::BRANCH \"integration/save-edition\""
	SPEC "wave 7 carries milestone fix-corrupted-save and branch integration/fix-corrupted-save"
		IMPL "docs/awawa-project-methodology/waves.awawa::MILESTONE \"fix-corrupted-save\""
		IMPL "docs/awawa-project-methodology/waves.awawa::BRANCH \"integration/fix-corrupted-save\""
	SPEC "AGENTS.md and the files of agents/ name no integration branch: the base of a task is the"
		+ "BRANCH of its wave, master for a task with no wave"
		IMPL "AGENTS.md::La base d'une tâche est le `BRANCH` de sa wave"
		IMPL "agents/worktree.md::c'est le `BRANCH` de sa wave"
	RATIONALE "WAVE is a bare uint today: an agent launched on a task learns its number, not the"
		+ "branch to cut from nor the milestone to set on the pull request, so it asks, or reads"
		+ "the base from AGENTS.md, which names it in prose and drifts — on 2026-09-24 it still"
		+ "named integration/save-format-preserved while the open milestone and branch were"
		+ "release-and-hardening. AGENTS.md kept the base out of the corpus because a DESC"
		+ "rewritten every month gains nothing; one entity per wave is written once and never"
		+ "rewritten, which removes that objection. Waves 6 and 7 name a milestone and a branch"
		+ "that do not exist yet on GitHub: they are created when the wave is launched, not by this"
		+ "task. Wave 8, release-and-hardening, lives on its integration branch and is declared"
		+ "there. The wave-start command, outside this repository, is changed alongside to read"
		+ "BRANCH and MILESTONE from the wave instead of asking, and to pass the milestone to the"
		+ "pull request it opens"
	SOURCE "Owner request and refinement, session of 2026-09-24"

