		+ "scripts/ and of core-mapping/scripts/ whose body runs only under import.meta.main,"
		+ "check-scenario-fixtures.ts and specSources.ts at 41.67 % of lines,"
		+ "generate-section-validators.ts at 0 % of functions: a test spawning them fails to raise"
		+ "the figure, as Bun never reports a spawned module, so their input and output is injected"
		+ "and the real adapter alone ignored. release.ts, release-tag.ts and check-site.ts have no"
		+ "import.meta.main block and are the process their test spawns: ruled out of scope by the"
		+ "owner on 2026-09-26, they stay tested as real processes and exempt in"
		+ "fallow-coverage-gaps.toml. The unexecuted lines of sectionValidators.generated.js are"
		+ "two field dependencies of the save schema, a validation rule no test asserts. The"
		+ "unusable-merged-save outcome of the merge CLI is reached by no save, every parse error"
		+ "being a validation error first, but the presenter of core-mapping emits it: the CLI"
		+ "receives its merge controller and the test hands one answering that outcome. Bun counts"
		+ "a class as a function no call reaches, even once instantiated: a one-method class sits"
		+ "at 50 % of functions and 100 % of lines, which is why the controllers of core-mapping"
		+ "read 66.67 %; a function gap naming no line is no use case missed, and the owner ruled"
		+ "on 2026-09-26 that the function threshold is dropped, the line threshold catching every"
		+ "uncalled function whose body holds a line"
		REF @DECISION.UnitTestCoverageIsGatedAtTheMeasuredFloorOfEachModule
		REF @DECISION.AControllerSpecCoversWiringNotBranches
		REF @DECISION.EveryPublishedCommandHasARealProcessTest
		REF @DECISION.AScriptTestInjectsItsInputAndOutputAndCoverageIgnoresTheRealAdapter
	SOURCE "Owner request on the review of CHORE105, and the owner's ruling on its intent in the"
		+ "same review"
		PR 173
	SOURCE "Owner rulings, refinement session of 2026-09-26"

