TASK FEAT151
	TITLE "Offer on the Load save page to load again a save loaded before"
	STATUS todo
	SPEC "while saves are not kept, the Load save page offers a Remember saves button; it opens a"
		+ "modal warning that the saves kept, player names included, stay in this browser for"
		+ "anyone using this computer, with a Confirm and a Cancel button, Cancel closing it and"
		+ "keeping nothing"
	SPEC "once confirmed, the Remember saves button is gone, and the save loaded, if any, and every"
		+ "save loaded next are kept in the browser, the last five loaded; a sixth drops the"
		+ "oldest, and a kept save loaded again moves to the top instead of taking a second place"
	SPEC "the saves kept survive a reload of the page and a new visit; the Load save page lists"
		+ "them newest first, each by its file name and the date it was loaded, with a button that"
		+ "loads it again and a button that removes it from the browser"
	SPEC "a save loaded again goes through the validation of a picked file, its warnings and errors"
		+ "shown the same way, and opens the Overview page once it validates"
	AFTER @TASK.FEAT137
	WAVE @WAVE.13
	RATIONALE "The save manager holds the loaded save in memory only, so a reader coming back to a"
		+ "save picks its file again. A save weighs about 2 MB, beyond what the browser's key-value"
		+ "storage holds for five saves, hence a browser database; nothing reaches the server. The"
		+ "saves carry the real names of the players, so nothing is kept until the reader asks for"
		+ "it by a button, never by a modal opening on its own, and a refusal leaves nothing to"
		+ "record. Loading a kept save again takes the path of a picked file, so no second load"
		+ "path exists. The storage this task builds is the one FIX152 needs to survive a reload,"
		+ "and the one FEAT153 clears and FEAT154 bounds in time"
		REF @TASK.FIX152
		REF @TASK.FEAT153
		REF @TASK.FEAT154
		REF @DECISION.SectionControllersReceiveTheValidatedText
		REF @DECISION.OneLoadSavePageLoadsTheFirstAndEveryNextSave
	SOURCE "Owner review of pull request 211, then the owner's ruling of 2026-09-28 when the task"
		+ "was refined: a wave of its own, the last five saves, kept only after a Remember saves"
		+ "button and a modal with a shared-computer warning, each save removable"
		PR 211

